# Generated build evidence retains upstream whitespace and exact bytes.
**/results/**/artifacts/*.log binary
**/results/**/artifacts/**/*.log binary
# Host inspection stdout/stderr retain exact newlines and diagnostic bytes.
**/results/**/artifacts/host-controls/**/*-stdout.txt binary
**/results/**/artifacts/host-controls/**/*-stderr.txt binary
**/results/**/artifacts/*.ninja binary
**/results/**/artifacts/*.map binary
